      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "## FinOps — AWS Cost Visibility\n\n**Fonte de dados:** Prometheus (metricas via Lambda `finops-cost-exporter` → Pushgateway → Prometheus)\n\n**Latencia dos dados:** 12-24h (Lambda executa via EventBridge Schedule)\n\n**Budget atual:** $807/mes USD (~R$ 4.842/mes @ R$ 6,00/USD)\n\n**Metricas disponiveis:**\n- `aws_cost_daily_usd` — custo diario por servico AWS\n- `aws_cost_mtd_usd` — custo acumulado no mes (Month-To-Date)\n- `aws_cost_forecast_usd` — projecao de custo para o final do mes\n- `aws_cost_by_tag_usd` — custo por tag `app=` (chargeback por aplicacao)\n- `aws_budget_limit_usd` — limite de budget configurado no AWS Budgets\n- `aws_budget_actual_usd` — custo real reportado pelo AWS Budgets\n\n**Historico:** Jan/26 parcial | Fev/26 = $914.41 | Mar/26 MTD = $199.62 (2026-03-06)\n\n**Contato:** Platform Team — canal `#finops-aws` | Runbook: https://wiki.internal/finops"
      },
